pe must be provided.\");\n    }\n    return s;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Construct mapping instance (Map, JavaBean) when the runtime class is known.\n   */\n  protected class ConstructMapping implements Construct {\n\n[525 more lines in file. Use offset=140 to continue.]"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1792454330801}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_iuOYYkHhdNCvChAX20pdR8ln|fc_0afec38eb29cac6c016ad6aeba785887d19516eebc8f1cd942", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/source_context/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/main/extracted/org/apache/pulsar/shade/com/fasterxml/jackson/jaxrs/json/JsonMapperConfigurator.java:17:public class JsonMapperConfigurator\n/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/source_context/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/main/extracted/org/apache/pulsar/shade/com/fasterxml/jackson/jaxrs/json/JsonMapperConfigurator.java:18:    extends MapperConfiguratorBase<JsonMapperConfigurator, ObjectMapper>\n/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/source_context/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/main/extracted/org/apache/pulsar/shade/com/fasterxml/jackson/jaxrs/json/JsonMapperConfigurator.java:29:    public JsonMapperConfigurator(ObjectMapper mapper, Annotations[] defAnnotations)\n/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/source_context/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/main/extracted/org/apache/pulsar/shade/com/fasterxml/jackson/jaxrs/json/JsonMapperConfigurator.java:51:                    _setAnnotations(_defaultMapper, _defaultAnnotationsToUse);\n/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/source_context/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/main/extracted/org/apache/pulsar/shade/com/fasterxml/jackson/jaxrs/json/JsonMapperConfigurator.java:79:                    _setAnnotations(_mapper, _defaultAnnota